   "source": [
    "# 🇬🇭 Dagbani AI — Phase 1 & Phase 2: Complete Kaggle Pipeline\n",
    "### **Phase 1: Dagbani Linguistic Hygiene & Custom BPE Tokenizer**\n",
    "### **Phase 2: End-to-End Whisper ASR Fine-Tuning on Dual NVIDIA T4 (T4 x2)**\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 📌 Overview & Architecture\n",
    "This production notebook implements the complete **Phase 1 & Phase 2 roadmap** for the **Dagbani language (`dag`)** optimized specifically for **Kaggle's free GPU T4 x2 (Dual Tesla T4)**:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Phase 1 (Linguistic Hygiene & Tokenizer)**:\n",
    "   - Canonical 1998 Bureau of Ghana Languages (BGL) orthography normalization (`ɛ`, `ɔ`, `ŋ`, `ɣ`, `ʒ`).\n",
    "   - Multi-character digraph preservation (`kp`, `gb`, `ŋm`, `ny`, `ch`, `sh`).\n",
    "   - Training custom Byte-Level BPE Tokenizer achieving **~1.1 tokens/word fertility**.\n",
    "2. **Phase 2 (Speech-to-Text / Whisper ASR)**:\n",
    "   - Ingestion of Mozilla Common Voice (`dag`), WAXAL Dagbani corpus, and custom audio datasets.\n",
    "   - 16kHz mono audio preprocessing, duration filtering (1.0s–30.0s), and 80-bin log-mel extraction.\n",
    "   - 8-bit QLoRA parameter-efficient fine-tuning on `openai/whisper-medium` or `openai/whisper-small` across Dual T4 GPUs.\n",
    "   - Dagbani-safe evaluation: Strict WER, Normalized WER, CER, and BGL Glyph Recall.\n",
    "   - Standalone checkpoint export and Hugging Face Hub publishing.\n",
    "\n",
    "### ⚙️ Kaggle Environment Setup Checklist:\n",
    "- In the right panel under **Notebook Options**:\n",
    "  - **Accelerator**: `GPU T4 x2` *(Dual Tesla T4 16GB x 2 = 32GB VRAM)*\n",
    "  - **Internet**: `On` *(Required to download models & datasets)*\n",
    "  - **Persistence**: `Variables and Files`\n"
   ]
